#: telescope/app.py:56
msgid "The phone's camera is making fewer frames than asked for. Dim light slows it down."
msgstr "휴대폰 카메라가 요청한 것보다 적은 프레임을 만들고 있어요. 어두운 곳에서는 속도가 느려져요."

#: telescope/app.py:57
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Dynamic lowered the frame rate to {fps} fps to keep up with a slow connection."
msgstr "'동적' 모드가 느린 연결에 맞춰 프레임 레이트를 {fps} fps로 낮췄어요."

#: telescope/app.py:58
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The phone got hot and lowered the frame rate to {fps} fps for now."
msgstr "휴대폰이 뜨거워져 일시적으로 프레임 레이트를 {fps} fps로 낮췄어요."

#: telescope/app.py:128
msgid "Lost the phone - reconnecting"
msgstr "휴대폰과의 연결이 끊겼어요 - 다시 연결 중"

#: telescope/app.py:169 telescope/plugins/browser_camera.py:569 telescope/plugins/connection.py:1198 telescope/plugins/connection.py:1242 telescope/plugins/connection.py:1402 telescope/plugins/connection.py:1438 telescope/plugins/onboarding.py:267 telescope/plugins/setup.py:829 telescope/plugins/updates.py:108 telescope/sources.py:918 telescope/widgets/vaapi_setup.py:300
