#, python-brace-format
msgid "{plugins} is turned off"
msgid_plural "{plugins} are turned off"
msgstr[0] "{plugins}이(가) 꺼져 있어요"

#: telescope/app.py:525
msgid "You turned this off in Plugins. To get it back, open Plugins in Settings and switch it on."
msgid_plural "You turned these off in Plugins. To get them back, open Plugins in Settings and switch them on."
msgstr[0] "플러그인에서 꺼 둔 상태예요. 다시 사용하려면 설정에서 플러그인을 열어 켜세요."

#: telescope/app.py:557
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Plugins ({n} off)"
msgstr "플러그인({n}개 꺼짐)"

#: telescope/app.py:585
#, python-brace-format
msgid "A copy of the old file is at {path}."
msgstr "이전 파일의 사본이 {path}에 있어요."

#: telescope/app.py:587
msgid "Your settings couldn't be read"
msgstr "설정을 읽을 수 없어요"

#: telescope/app.py:588
msgid "Telescope started with its defaults, so paired phones need pairing again."
msgstr "Telescope가 기본값으로 시작되어, 페어링된 휴대폰을 다시 페어링해야 해요."

#: telescope/app.py:640 telescope/app.py:641 telescope/plugins/on_air.py:208 telescope/widgets/settings_window.py:157
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "설정"

#: telescope/app.py:650
msgid "Stream another camera at the same time, to a virtual camera of its own"
msgstr "다른 카메라를 별도의 가상 카메라로 동시에 스트리밍해요"

